  clueText: "Something about this camp doesn\u2019t feel right. It feels like there\u2019s
    a strange weight in the air. I\u2019ve heard whispers that this place was built
    on cursed ground. They say it\u2019s an old superstition passed around the campfire,
    but sometimes.. I\u2019m not so sure. Maybe there\u2019s more truth in those
    rumors than anyone wants to admit\u2026"
